{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51452","headline":"沧洲〖1〗 · 李羣玉","name":"沧洲〖1〗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"童儿待郭汲，竹马空迟留。\n路指云汉津，谁能吟《四愁》。\n银壶傲海雪，青管罗名讴。\n贱子迹未安，谋身拙如鸠。\n分随烟霞老，岂有风云求。\n不逐万物化，但贻知己羞。\n方穷力命说，战胜心悠悠。\n不然蹲会稽，鈎下二五牛。\n所期波涛助，燀赫呈吞舟。\n（四部业刊影宋本《李羣玉诗便携集》卷上）（〖1〗《全唐诗》卷五六八收作《洞庭驿楼雪讌集奉赠前湘州张员外》之後半篇，似误。\n王安石《唐百家诗选》卷十七亦以此诗自爲一首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}